<title>USA: U.S. debt futures narrowly mixed, T-bonds turn up.</title>
<headline>U.S. debt futures narrowly mixed, T-bonds turn up.</headline>
<text>
<p>July 10 - U.S. debt futures were narrowly mixed in light afternoon trade. Sept T-bonds inched up to 113-30/32 after one U.S. dealer bought 1,000 contracts. Buy-stop orders were hit at 113-26/32 to 113-28/32, which forced some locals to cover short positions.</p>
<p>((Chicago derivatives desk (312)408-8750))</p>
